# Presentation

## Copy (l10n)

- Fluxo: `ICopySource` → ModelsBuilder → `*TextsModel`.
- Screen e ViewModel **não** acessam `AppLocalizations` nem `context.l10n`.

## Components burros

- Props: model de textos + `*DataModel?` nullable.
- `data == null` → shimmer de loading do design system (no próprio component).

## Analytics

- Encapsulado: `trackAction` / `trackPageView` + `eventName` via tracker — não inline no ViewModel.

## Design system

- Reusar tokens e widgets do DS **do projeto**. Closest match no Figma; sem UI paralela.

## Testes de widget

- Keys via `KeysEnum` (`IKeyEnum`). Sem `find.text` de copy configurável em screen/flow tests.

Skills: l10n, ui-components, design-system, widget-testing, screen-mvvm-architecture.
